---
description: Project rules for the Ava voice presentation agent
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md at the repository root. It is the single source of rules for coding agents in this repo.

The most important rules, repeated here:

- Never open, read, print, paste or commit `.env`, and never put a secret in a `VITE_*` variable or client code.
- Build milestones from docs/implementation.md in order, with tests, one commit per milestone.
- Only the presentation controller creates responses; provider event names live only in web/src/voice/openai/events.ts.
- Answers come from reviewed deck facts only.
